{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crop Survivor is a cozy horror game where you take care of your farm in a small town near a nuclear reactor. You play as a lonely farmer on your daily routine to plant, and fix your farm tools. Little did you know, you would need to find a way to escape the peaceful place you love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay:</u></strong>\u00a0Fix your farm equipment, and plant crops that can fight for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Story</strong></u>: Unravel what is happening in your town, while trying to escape your farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Endings:</u></strong>\u00a03 different endings</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986660?t=1760032805","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986660?t=1760032805","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986660/2ebbf2486056646202cb2be75291f5b56dd17393/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760032805","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986660/2ebbf2486056646202cb2be75291f5b56dd17393/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760032805","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crop Survivor is a cozy horror game where you take care of your farm in a small town near a nuclear reactor. You play as a lonely farmer on your daily routine to plant, and fix your farm tools. Little did you know, you would need to find a way to escape the peaceful place you love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stro